id: pm-rlm-3isb
title: Reduce full-snapshot ledger storage amplification for large repeated runs
description: The first implementation stores source snapshot and transcript in the root checkpoint. Public eval corpora expose repeated full-string history updates and complete-read cost as run count grows. A future storage design should distribute immutable snapshots while preserving one atomic budget coordinate.
